From: knulli
Subject: [PATCH] env: Kconfig: ENV_SIZE is needed with ENV_IS_NOWHERE too

include/environment.h sizes the in-memory environment with CONFIG_ENV_SIZE
regardless of where (or whether) it is stored, but Kconfig hides the symbol
for ENV_IS_NOWHERE and the build fails in asm-offsets.

diff --git a/env/Kconfig b/env/Kconfig
index 1faa33f78c..16f1889bee 100644
--- a/env/Kconfig
+++ b/env/Kconfig
@@ -469,7 +469,6 @@ config ENV_OFFSET
 
 config ENV_SIZE
 	hex "Environment Size"
-	depends on !ENV_IS_NOWHERE
 	default 0x20000 if ARCH_SUNXI
 	help
 	  Size of the environment storage area
